<title>FRANCE: Banque Paribas ROE 18 pct in H1 1996.</title>
<headline>Banque Paribas ROE 18 pct in H1 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Chairman Andre Levy-Lang said its Banque Paribas unit would post a return on equity for full year 1996 slightly less than it did in the first half.</p>
<p>&quot;Excluding capital gains, return on equity before taxes was 18 percent in the first half on an annualised basis,&quot; Levy-Lang said in an interview with weekly Le Journal des Finances. &quot;It will be a little lower for the whole year, taking into account the seasonal nature of market activity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
